#34=IFCWORKPLAN('3b025q5ZnfNdWnbJDLGhQE',#6,'Carport HW - Rev1 through first mass-production shipment release','Hardware development proposal as of 2026-10-31. Rev0 complete; Rev1 schematic out for review and layout underway. US/Canada initial markets; international expansion later. NTN remains evaluation with explicit Rev2 gate. Dates are dependency-calculated estimates; named staffing, supplier commitments, quantities and lab slots unconfirmed. Software has separate backlogs and appears only as delivery gates. Read docs/carport-hw-planning-basis.md for scope, assumptions, qualification strategy and source register. No historical actual dates or invented progress. Baseline is an unapproved proposal. Qualification starts on Rev2 for suitable electrical/conducted work; enclosure-sensitive campaigns start on representative T1 while T2 proceeds. Final T2 delta review/retests protect market release. The original unapproved proposal baseline is preserved.',$,$,'2026-11-01T04:24:03',$,$,$,$,'2026-11-02T09:00:00','2027-09-21T17:00:00',.PLANNED.);
