#59=IFCTASK('1evCviTUqGw5E8oV_WjE6f',#6,'Close Rev1 schematic review and BOM metadata','Resolve reviewer comments and R2-03 MPN/tolerance/voltage/dielectric metadata; regenerate correct dev/production variants, BOM and netlist; run Altium compiler/ERC; unresolved risks have written containment. Saved source, reviewed PDF and exports agree.','USERDEFINED','2.1',$,$,$,.F.,$,#58,.USERDEFINED.);
