#61=IFCTASK('2CBeqxHM1c6p8GPFXIKpW3',#6,'Complete Rev1 routing and RF / power / mechanical review','Layout review checks switcher hot loops, return paths, antenna keep-outs/feed/matching, GNSS isolation, debug/test access, thermal copper, USB, pigtail, button/LED alignment, board outline and tolerances. DRC and 3D clearance review pass.','USERDEFINED','2.2',$,$,$,.F.,$,#60,.USERDEFINED.);
