#87=IFCTASK('1UAmRgRBcmI1x6On1WVfep',#6,'Rev1 antenna, coexistence and EMC pre-scan','In representative enclosure/cabling, assess BLE/Wi-Fi/cellular transmit and GNSS receive sensitivity/TTFF, coexistence/desense and switcher noise; bench/conducted checks plus radiated pre-scan; antenna candidates, retuning needs and lab modes documented.','USERDEFINED','3.6',$,$,$,.F.,$,#86,.USERDEFINED.);
