#101=IFCTASK('04HTCBCBT4SsO0x8EocXVJ',#6,'Tool-ready enclosure, vent process and cable assembly DFM','Production resin, surface/texture, shrink/tolerances, fastening, draft/parting/ejection, undercuts, gasket, pigtail molding or grommet strategy, USB sealing, membrane bond lands and grill process finalized. Humidity and acoustic stack validated; tooling scope includes any separate strain-relief/insert tools.','USERDEFINED','4.4',$,$,$,.F.,$,#100,.USERDEFINED.);
