#1261=IFCPROPERTYSINGLEVALUE('Notes',$,IFCTEXT('[{"id":"LABPLAN-exit","text":"Exit: Written US FCC / Canada ISED route, exact ESP32 and nRF module grants/integration conditions, antennas and gains, RF exposure/use distance and simultaneous transmit cases; host emissions, GNSS receive performance, cellular/operator and Bluetooth qualification scope. Evaluate safety/battery/shipping and vehicle approval applicability. Lab quote, sample counts, modes and slot strategy recorded. Agree which electrical, conducted RF, network/protocol and documentation results may be accepted from Rev2 in printed housings; identify enclosure-sensitive tests, representative T1 sample requirements and T2 delta/retest rules.","done":false}]'),$);
