#1402=IFCPROPERTYSINGLEVALUE('Notes',$,IFCTEXT('[{"id":"LABSAMPLE-exit","text":"Exit: Lab signs sample/configuration matrix: molded production-intent resin, antenna location/cables, fastening, pigtail/grill and ePTFE/adhesive stack with recorded dimensions/process. Hand-cut/applied parts can be accepted when they represent the intended controlled assembly method; printed materials do not establish molded enclosure qualification. Nonrepresentative items remain provisional and trigger affected T2 tests; no assumption that T1 is already equivalent.","done":false}]'),$);
