#1411=IFCPROPERTYSINGLEVALUE('Notes',$,IFCTEXT('[{"id":"QUALENV-exit","text":"Exit: Run approved environmental/cable/membrane DVP&R on lab-accepted production-intent molded T1 assemblies: temperature/humidity/condensation/cycles, vibration/shock/drop, ingress target, scoped fluid/UV, pull/flex and connector/button life. Measure acoustic/RH response and bonding/grill performance before/after. Record controlled hand-assembly method where representative; substitute material or process results are provisional. T2 delta review determines repeats; long-duration aging adds explicit time.","done":false}]'),$);
