#1414=IFCPROPERTYSINGLEVALUE('Notes',$,IFCTEXT('[{"id":"FCCIC-exit","text":"Exit: Test/assess lab-accepted representative Rev2/T1 configuration against applicable rules and module grant restrictions, antenna gains/bands, simultaneous transmit modes, RF exposure and host emissions. Formal radiated results require representative mechanics; printed parts alone do not establish final conformity. Obtain reports/filing-route conclusion; final applicability to T2 is decided at explicit delta gate.","done":false}]'),$);
