#1426=IFCPROPERTYSINGLEVALUE('Notes',$,IFCTEXT('[{"id":"BATT-exit","text":"Exit: Confirm actual cell/pack chemistry/configuration and applicable safety evaluation, protection/charging temperature behavior; UN 38.3 test summary for shipped lithium configuration and packaging requirements where applicable, supplier safety files, resin flammability and material declarations. New/modified pack testing requires a separate quoted loop; module approvals do not cover this.","done":false}]'),$);
