#1429=IFCPROPERTYSINGLEVALUE('Notes',$,IFCTEXT('[{"id":"QUALDELTA-exit","text":"Exit: Compare tested Rev2/T1 and final T2 BOM, PCB, antennas/matching, firmware/radio limits, resin/texture, geometry/seals, adhesive/membrane/grill, cable and assembly process. Lab/quality approve which reports carry forward and list affected tests/filings/acceptances for repetition; no automatic certificate transfer. Minor repeats use the visible reserve; major changes extend schedule. Release remains blocked until final configuration is covered.","done":false}]'),$);
